1075
01:36:02,384 --> 01:36:03,928
Vamos.

1076
01:36:05,221 --> 01:36:06,639
Tchau, pai.

1077
01:36:06,639 --> 01:36:08,140
Boa noite, mãe.

1078
01:36:08,140 --> 01:36:09,934
Tchau. Divirtam-se.

1079
01:36:09,975 --> 01:36:11,101
Boa noite, Sandy.

1080
01:36:11,143 --> 01:36:12,269
