1142
01:42:12,379 --> 01:42:13,839
Meu Deus.

1143
01:42:13,881 --> 01:42:15,841
É você, Jeffrey?

1144
01:42:15,883 --> 01:42:18,344
Sim, sou eu.

1145
01:42:18,385 --> 01:42:19,887
Jeffrey.

1146
01:42:21,889 --> 01:42:22,932
Jeffrey.

